        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE Only certain parts of this annex (H.1.5 and its subclauses, H.1.6, H.2 and its subclauses, H.6 and H.7) have been fully reviewed and updated in this document. The rest (H.1 and its subclauses not listed previously, H.3, H.4 and H.5 and its subclauses) will be improved upon in the next edition. It is important for the implementers to be careful when reading and designing systems relying on information mentioned in those clauses that have not been reviewed and updated in this document.",
            "block_bbox": [
